1
00:00:00,467 --> 00:00:02,297
(Howard:)for a relationship.

2
00:00:02,302 --> 00:00:05,372
(Sheldon:)Yeah, he's right.
Once, in a moment of candor,

3
00:00:05,372 --> 00:00:08,172
(Sheldon:)I told Amy
that her hair reminded me

4
00:00:08,175 --> 00:00:11,305
(Sheldon:)of a duck caught
in an oil spill. Well...

5
00:00:11,311 --> 00:00:13,281
(Sheldon:)she stormed out.

6
00:00:13,280 --> 00:00:16,080
(Sheldon:)Which was sad, because
we were playing Scrabble,

7
00:00:16,083 --> 00:00:20,223
(Sheldon:)and I had all the letters
to spell "persimmon."

8
00:00:23,557 --> 00:00:25,927
(Leonard:)Why are you even part
of this conversation?

9
00:00:25,926 --> 00:00:27,796
(Leonard:)You don't know
anything about women.

10
00:00:27,794 --> 00:00:30,464
(Sheldon:)I know that if I had
a wife or a fiancée,

11
00:00:30,464 --> 00:00:32,494
(Sheldon:)I'd ask her first
before I invested money

12
00:00:32,499 --> 00:00:34,399
(Sheldon:)in a comic book store.

13
00:00:34,401 --> 00:00:36,031
(sighs)
He's right.

14
00:00:36,036 --> 00:00:37,106
(Leonard:)Yeah, well,

15
00:00:37,104 --> 00:00:38,374
(Sheldon:)of course I am.

16
00:00:38,371 --> 00:00:39,841
(Sheldon:)I was also right about her hair.

17
00:00:39,840 --> 00:00:41,770
(Sheldon:)It did everything but quack.

18
00:00:45,078 --> 00:00:47,348
(Leonard:)There's something
I wanted to run past you.

19
00:00:47,347 --> 00:00:49,477
(Penny:)What's up?
Mm, the guys and I

20
00:00:49,483 --> 00:00:52,313
(Leonard:)were thinking about investing
in Stuart's comic book store.

21
00:00:52,319 --> 00:00:54,789
(Leonard:)Is that okay?
Why are you asking me?

22
00:00:54,788 --> 00:00:56,618
(Leonard:)Well, you know,
we're engaged,

23
00:00:56,623 --> 00:00:59,123
(Leonard:)and it's kind of
a big deal financially.

